    "created_at": "2021-09-30T11:48:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-30T11:48:47Z",
    "body": "I mean the \"autocomplete\" attribute of the \"input\" element where type equals \"text\".\r\n\r\n<input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"family-name\"/>\r\n<input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"surname\"/>\r\n\r\nThere are multiple values for autocomplete at the moment, one of which is \"family-name\".\r\nI suggested we add \"surname\" to that list.\r\nThe list is documented here for developers:\r\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/autocomplete",
    "author_association": "NONE",
